# RC_JOBS=rc.jobs.mapapp: HakiOS Maps, the Leaflet/OpenStreetMap screen, installed the LocProbe
# way (copy into /var/jb/Applications, uicache, uiopen) and left up; its own log is cat'd late,
# and the external screenshot script catches the window.
#
# Why a map of our own: Apple Maps' canvas stays black because VectorKit's Metal pipelines are
# not served yet; the tile images here take the path Safari already renders.
# The app logs to /private/var/tmp/hmaps.log (and /var/jb/hmaps/maps.log, for which the directory
# must be world-writable: the app runs as uid 501).  A run cannot type, so the search query is
# left in /private/var/tmp/hmaps-search.txt and the app searches by itself three seconds in
# (HakiosMaps.m, autoSearchFired:): the first hit is then taken and the map recenters.
#
# Registration: `uicache -p` names this bundle instead of rescanning everything, and
# `uicache -i` then says what LaunchServices holds for the id -- both into install.log, which is
# cat'd at the end.  Under QEMU `uicache -a` + `uiopen --bundleid` left no trace in launchd while
# Settings opened, so the id's registration is the first thing to read there; on the phone the
# same route launched LocProbe from /private/var/jb/Applications.  Three launch routes follow:
# bundle id, the app's URL scheme (LocProbe's first launch took that one), and --path.
/redwood/bin/rwtouch wait 35
/var/jb/usr/bin/mkdir -p /var/jb/Applications /var/jb/hmaps
/var/jb/usr/bin/chmod 777 /var/jb/hmaps
/var/jb/bin/echo 西安大雁塔 >> /private/var/tmp/hmaps-search.txt
/var/jb/usr/bin/cp -R /redwood/fw/hmaps/HakiosMaps.app /var/jb/Applications/
/var/jb/usr/bin/chmod 755 /var/jb/Applications/HakiosMaps.app/HakiosMaps
/var/jb/usr/bin/ls -l /var/jb/Applications/HakiosMaps.app >> /var/jb/hmaps/install.log
/var/jb/usr/bin/uicache -p /var/jb/Applications/HakiosMaps.app >> /var/jb/hmaps/install.log
/var/jb/usr/bin/uicache -i com.hakios.maps >> /var/jb/hmaps/install.log
/redwood/bin/rwtouch wait 10
/var/jb/usr/bin/uiopen --bundleid com.hakios.maps
/redwood/bin/rwtouch wait 15
/var/jb/usr/bin/uiopen hakiosmaps://
/redwood/bin/rwtouch wait 15
/var/jb/usr/bin/uiopen --path /var/jb/Applications/HakiosMaps.app
/redwood/bin/rwtouch wait 45
/var/jb/usr/bin/cat /var/jb/hmaps/install.log
/var/jb/usr/bin/cat /private/var/tmp/hmaps.log
sleep 25
/var/jb/usr/bin/cat /private/var/tmp/hmaps.log
